@startuml
!theme plain
left to right direction
title Method Stack With Paper References

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #19226D
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle "Road Scene Understanding\n\nmulti-camera -> BEV/occupancy\nobject tracking\nlane context" as Road #EAF2FF
rectangle "Distance + TTC\n\ndepth ROI\nsingle-view geometry\nrelative velocity" as TTC #FFF7EE
rectangle "Driver State / DMS\n\ndrowsiness\ndistraction\nunsafe behaviors" as DMS #EAF2FF
rectangle "Fusion + Risk Learning\n\nverified labels + rule guardrails\nGBDT / temporal model" as Fusion #F37021
rectangle "Post-Inference Discovery\n\nrisk embedding clustering\nLLM semantic cluster labels\nnot used for training" as Discovery #FFF7EE
rectangle "Trip Score + Coaching\n\nrisk aggregation\nexplainable score\nIVI / post-trip action" as Score #034EA2

Road --> TTC
TTC --> Fusion
DMS --> Fusion
Fusion --> Score
Fusion --> Discovery
Discovery --> Score : analytics labels

note bottom of Road
References:
SurroundOcc
Multi-camera BEV Perception
Cam4DOcc
6D-VNet as extension
end note

note bottom of TTC
References:
Real-time Vehicle Distance Estimation
TTC-AMD Study
Speed Estimation from Video
end note

note bottom of DMS
References:
Real-Time Sleepiness Detection
DMS Survey
Multimodal Fatigue Detection
HRV Drowsiness Detection
end note

@enduml
